<h3>How this is estimated</h3>

The estimate scales a per-repetition energy cost by your body weight,
using 68 kg as the reference point.

<h3>Why estimates vary</h3>

Tempo matters a great deal with burpees — the same rep count performed
faster raises energy cost considerably.
